{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race Wars is a modern take on Retro top down racers. You and up to 5 other racers hit the track in your selected vehicle and battle it out. Circuit racing, Drag racing, and more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built around the idea that arcade games feel too &quot;arcade&quot;, but sim games can be quite time consuming to get into. This game takes sim like physics and puts them in a pickup arcade racer that is best enjoyed either with friends, or a never ending time trial session where you race to find that last tenth.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3488710?t=1768960483","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488710/4c3ee063bcea101518e03c0281e403cf8566b931/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768960483","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488710/eff1fe8395c6068b34b951f325e0f8585ebb755b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768960483","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488710/eff1fe8395c6068b34b951f325e0f8585ebb755b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768960483","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race Wars is a modern take on Retro top down racers. You and up to 5 other racers hit the track in your selected vehicle and batt